      "patch": "@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@\n+pymalloc returns memory blocks aligned by 16 bytes, instead of 8 bytes, on\n+64-bit platforms to conform x86-64 ABI. Recent compilers assume this alignment\n+more often. Patch by Inada Naoki."
    },
